* DA2033-AL  flyback transformer, 1:10 (Coilcraft)
* Datasheet-based model for ngspice. Coilcraft publishes no SPICE model
* for this part.
* Source: docs/datasheets/da2032.pdf (Document 510, revised 03/07/25).
* See prototype1/README.md for how each parameter was derived.
*
* Pins: p_dot p  s_dot s      (p_dot and s_dot are the dotted ends)
* The four primary windings are connected in parallel, as the datasheet
* requires, and appear here as one winding.
.subckt DA2033AL p_dot p s_dot s
.param LP=10u  NTURNS=10  LLK=0.144u
.param KC={sqrt(1 - LLK/LP)}
RP  p_dot p1 15m
LP  p1 p {LP}
RS  s_dot s1 1.1
LS  s1 s {LP*NTURNS*NTURNS}
KT  LP LS {KC}
* Effective winding capacitance seen at the secondary: one third of the
* 76 pF interwinding capacitance (linear voltage distribution estimate).
CW  s_dot s 25p
.ends DA2033AL
